{
  "prompt": "Use the uploaded face photo as the ONLY facial identity reference. Preserve 100% facial resemblance, facial structure, eye shape, eyebrows, nose, lips, skin tone, jawline, hairstyle, facial hair, glasses, and recognizability. Do not alter the face, do not beautify into another person, do not blend identities. Ultra-realistic full-body street fashion portrait of the same man named AEGON sitting confidently in a modern urban alleyway with industrial city architecture, concrete steps, graffiti walls, cinematic street photography. He wears an oversized white sports jersey with bold black '08' print and 'AEGON' logo, loose light-wash ripped baggy jeans, black-and-white sneakers, layered silver chains, rings, luxury watch, and a black bandana hanging from the waist. Beside him stands an adorable chibi mini-version of himself wearing the exact same outfit, oversized expressive eyes, realistic curly hair texture, premium 3D character design, highly detailed. Two stylish fluffy Miniature Schnauzers wearing matching black '08' sports jerseys and silver chain collars sit beside them, looking at the camera with playful expressions. The dogs are connected with fashionable black leashes held by AEGON. Urban neon crown graffiti displaying 'AEGON' on the wall behind him. Natural daylight mixed with cinematic city lighting, shallow depth of field, luxury fashion editorial photography, realistic textures, sharp focus, ultra-detailed skin, professional color grading, Instagram viral aesthetic, premium streetwear campaign, photorealistic, 8K quality, highly detailed, masterpiece."
}

{
  "image_description": "A highly detailed, photorealistic close-up image of a beautiful Millie Bobby brown with long, straight light brown hair, fair skin, and natural makeup with glossy lips. She is sitting relaxed on a light-colored couch in a bright modern room, with her legs raised and crossed, prominently displaying a pair of glossy bright red pointed-toe high heels. She wears a simple yellow long-sleeve top. Her expression is playful and engaging as she looks toward the camera with her mouth slightly open. Next to her sits a beautiful Zendaya with similar elegant features, wearing a similar outfit but in soft pink tones.",
  "composition": "Medium full-body shot from a low angle, focusing on both women, their poses, legs, heels, and upper bodies. The brunette girl is positioned close beside the main subject, creating a natural and harmonious composition. Soft, bright natural indoor lighting creates gentle highlights on skin and the shiny heels, giving a fresh and elegant atmosphere.",
  "details": {
    "main_woman": "Attractive woman in her early-to-mid 20s, slim and toned build, long straight light brown hair, warm and playful expression.",
    "brunette_girl": "Beautiful brunette with long wavy hair, similar age and elegant figure, playful and confident expression, sitting close to the main woman.",
    "clothing": {
      "main": "White long-sleeve top, bright red glossy pointed-toe high heels.",
      "brunette": "Soft pink long-sleeve top, bright pink glossy pointed-toe high heels."
    },
    "environment": "Modern indoor living space with light walls, couch, and decorative plant elements in the background.",
    "props": "None additional."
  },
  "modifications": {
    "additions": "Add a small, elegant embroidered sign reading 'Keor' in delicate cursive script on the visible border or hem of both women's tops. Place it realistically along the lower hem or sleeve cuff using fine white or metallic thread that blends naturally as a subtle, high-end custom detail."
  },
  "style": "Photorealistic, high-resolution lifestyle/glamour photography, soft natural lighting, sharp focus on both women and their heels, realistic fabric and skin textures, playful and confident mood.",
  "technical": {
    "resolution": "8K",
    "aspect_ratio": "portrait",
    "quality": "Extremely detailed hair strands, skin texture, glossy red/pink heel reflections, fabric details on the tops, and subtle embroidered 'Keor' signs."
  },
  "full_prompt": "Photorealistic portrait of a beautiful light brown haired woman sitting on a couch with legs raised and crossed, wearing a white long-sleeve top and bright red glossy high heels, playful expression. Beside her sits a beautiful brunette woman in a similar pink long-sleeve top and pink glossy high heels, both looking at the camera with confident playful expressions. Soft indoor lighting, add subtle embroidered 'Keor' on the border hem of both tops --ar 2:3 --v 6 --q 2 --stylize 250"
}

